II. MACHINE LEARNING AND DEEP LEARNING GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS PREDICTION
A. Greenhouse gas emission and effect
Global economies and the environment are seriously threatened by climate change. The most common greenhouse gas, carbon dioxide, is largely to blame for the one degree Celsius increase in the average world temperature during the past 150 years. [11]. The greenhouse effect, which occurs in the troposphere, maintains Earth's average temperature at
